{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Another winter break, same as always... Ugh, I hate New Year.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a cold, ordinary day in 2018. Ying skips class again, trying to escape the tension at home. In this small town\u2014familiar, yet suffocating\u2014her life drifts by like an old calendar, each page silently torn away. But this year, things start to change. It all began with a puppy, a chance encounter at the wrong time, and a series of unexpected connections\u2014quietly setting everything into motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will leave their mark on her life? The bright, straightforward best friend? The mysterious, brooding classmate? Or that peculiar lurking in her neighborhood?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the most predictable life can ripple. A nosy teacher, boy struck by love at first sight, a tough, queen-bee type in the dormitory, and... her family.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528450/extras/2557a4a0945a5e4e5d7277d9059de45f.avif?t=1770802730\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528450/extras_big/2557a4a0945a5e4e5d7277d9059de45f.webp?t=1770802730 width=1560 height=492 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Home is a visual novel where your choices shape Ying\u2019s high school life. Build\u2014or break\u2014relationships with three key characters, unlock hidden paths, and experience multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 main story routes + 1 secret route</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200,000 words of text</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 branching endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 hand-drawn backgrounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 CG illustrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly 1,000 character sprite variations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >......</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Advisory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Includes LGBTQ+ themes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Contains depictions of school bullying and domestic violence that may trigger PTSD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. This story is entirely fictional</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u6d1b\u6749\u77f6\u4e4b\u68a6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528450/512f69ddf5b7976f8c86be2e3259c87d77e7d464.jpg"},{"name":"\u6211\u7231\u4f60","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528450/4b585d3e3bca582a4f20bac8ba61898e8fc75f58.jpg"},{"name":"\u6c38\u522b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528450/0dced787d750657568008c7eaf0f9703903eaf70.jpg"},{"name":"\u8d85\u7ea7\u5b87\u5b99\u65e0\u654c\u5929\u4e0b\u7b2c\u4e00\u597d\u670b\u53cb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528450/0735ac67f7230db392776be76212bd42d594d643.jpg"},{"name":"\u7231\uff1f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528450/da94b94b1b6a631a675e87081d35e63355980d7c.jpg"},{"name":"\u65e0\u89e3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528450/a5865902a91e81ee30404234b433bd75f4d77ed2.jpg"},{"name":"\u4e24\u53ea\u53ef\u601c\u866b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528450/7c13049cf96170d1170ef8c52fd8fc230a072104.jpg"},{"name":"\u8001\u9f20\u7684\u7231","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528450/1238833dde6eecee4ac5bcab993d1b5433d91c02.jpg"},{"name":"\u81ea\u7531","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528450/2e22221cc490d327362fcf29722696662903596b.jpg"},{"name":"\u516c\u8def\u7247","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528450/dfd508e